### RoadLink Bus API — manual test requests
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (id: humao.rest-client).
### Once installed, a small "Send Request" link appears above every request
### below — click it to fire that call and see the response in a side panel.
###
### Run requests top to bottom the first time: several later ones reuse
### values captured from earlier responses (tripId, bookingReferenceId) via
### the {{name.response.body.$....}} syntax — no copy-pasting needed.
###
### If you've set API_KEY in api/.env, uncomment the x-api-key header lines
### below and fill in @apiKey.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@apiKey =

### Health check (no auth needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### Search buses — capture the first trip's id for later requests
# @name search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/buses/search?from=Chennai&to=Tirupati&date=2026-09-20
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

@tripId = {{search.response.body.$[0].tripId}}


### Trip detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}


### Seat map — check this to pick a genuinely "available" seat number below
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/seats
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}


### Create a booking — change "L1C" if that seat isn't available in your search
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "seatNumbers": ["L1C"],
  "passengers": [
    { "seatNumber": "L1C", "name": "Test User", "age": 30, "gender": "Male", "email": "test@example.com", "phone": "9876543210" }
  ],
  "contactEmail": "test@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "9876543210"
}

@refId = {{createBooking.response.body.bookingReferenceId}}


### Look up the booking by reference ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{refId}}
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}


### Reschedule — search a different date first (edit the query below), then
### paste that trip's id in place of newTripId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{refId}}/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "newTripId": "PASTE-A-DIFFERENT-TRIP-ID-HERE",
  "reason": "Change of plans"
}


### Cancel the booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{refId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "reason": "Testing cancellation"
}


### Send a (simulated) notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "bookingReferenceId": "{{refId}}",
  "type": "Booking Confirmation",
  "channel": "Email",
  "recipient": "test@example.com",
  "messageBody": "Your booking is confirmed."
}


### --- Error-handling checks ---

### Missing required fields -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{}


### Unknown booking reference -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/BK-DOESNOTEXIST
# x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
